#* {{quote-book|en|passage=It is endangered because of the very small populations which are cut off from other "'''businesses'''."|publisher=Christian Faith Publishing, Incorporated|title=Our Educational System Flipped Upside Down: Teaching Reading to Reduce the Negative Effects of School Closures During the Pandemic, and Beyond|author=Barbara Stotts Cochran|year=2022|url=https://www.google.com/books/edition/Our_Educational_System_Flipped_Upside_Do/sJxgEAAAQBAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&dq=businesses+of+ferrets+-gaggle+-collective+-+in+the+business+of&pg=PT15&printsec=frontcover}}
# {{lb|en|slang|British|with '''''the'''''}} Something very [[good]]; [[top]] [[quality]].
#: {{ux|en|These new phones are the '''business'''!}}
# {{lb|en|slang|uncountable}} The act of [[defecation]], or the [[excrement]] itself, particularly that of a non-human animal.
